{"id":1789,"date":"2021-01-19T08:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-01-19T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/?p=1789"},"modified":"2021-01-17T17:30:06","modified_gmt":"2021-01-17T16:30:06","slug":"the-new-gardening-season-is-coming-up-soon","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/en\/2021\/01\/19\/the-new-gardening-season-is-coming-up-soon\/","title":{"rendered":"The new gardening season is coming up soon"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The winter months are the best time to plan the new garden season. When the garden &#8222;hibernates&#8220;, I use the time to think about what I want to grow next year, have time to make plans for planting and also order seeds and necessary material for preparation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I have already started to order seeds. I got a list of seeds from the company Bingenheimer Saatgut (Germany), which offers very good seeds. Here I will order some vegetable seeds for testing. But because we want to plant the large arable land for soil improvement with potatoes this year, I will limit myself mainly to it (but of course I can\u00b4t live without some flowers \ud83d\ude42 Because large parts of the property still need to be cut free and the front outdoor area designed and planted, I am unfortunately not able to devote 100% to the garden yet. But from next year on I plan to grow many different varieties of fruits and vegetables.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/3595706a-ba74-4c87-8f09-d00db8f18c34.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1783\" data-full-url=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/3595706a-ba74-4c87-8f09-d00db8f18c34.jpg\" data-link=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/?attachment_id=1783\" class=\"wp-image-1783\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifes