4fdd6-9cae-44c5-9a24-b10e83043aed-e1610880411882-830x623.jpg 830w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1782\" data-full-url=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848.jpg\" data-link=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/?attachment_id=1782\" class=\"wp-image-1782\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-230x173.jpg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-350x263.jpg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-480x360.jpg 480w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-768x576.jpg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/320e3c3d-b1da-40c8-bb69-b6944fc3d4a1-e1610880399848-830x623.jpg 830w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Some plants and flowers need to be grown quite early, so that they manage in the cool region here in Thuringia, before the first frost comes in fall. Tomatoes and peppers, for example, are already sown in a few weeks here. From February to March I also grow some flowers in pots, like snapdragons, marigolds and many more. The ideal time for sowing is always written on the back of the seed bag. For this I simply use the plastic trays of fruits and vegetables, which are provided with holes, fill them with soil and you&#8217;re ready to go. I put the planting trays in a warm place in the window sill, and then it does not take long to see the first sprouts. The plants have to be watered, but be careful to avoid mold.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1776\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-230x173.jpg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-350x263.jpg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-480x360.jpg 480w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-768x576.jpg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/83aa34b5-933d-4eba-8e80-3ede345778ca-e1610879538647-830x623.jpg 830w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In the last few days I sat down and recorded the outside facilities of the Lifestylecenter Eyba. The approximately 2 ha large property has an incredible amount of capacity. So it is not so easy to find the right trees, shrubs and woody plants for the right spot. But it has been tremendous fun for me to learn about new plants and see which location suits which place. I&#8217;m still in the middle of it, but the results are worth seeing \ud83d\ude42 These drawings are definitely not finished yet, I&#8217;m always changing something. For this year my goal is to get as much as possible to be done and start implementing it right away in the spring. Let&#8217;s see how far we get\u2026.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-1 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1774\" data-full-url=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422.jpg\" data-link=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/?attachment_id=1774\" class=\"wp-image-1774\" srcset=\"http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-230x173.jpg 230w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-350x263.jpg 350w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-480x360.jpg 480w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-768x576.jpg 768w, http:\/\/lifestylecenter-eyba.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/67f21a80-4d7d-4edf-93dd-2dcb978794aa-e1610879568422-830x623.jpg 830w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"exce